# .gitignore raíz — prompt-security-system
# Complementa los .gitignore por servicio (Spring / Vite).
# Cubre lo que esos no cubren: env, uploads, build global, IDE, OS, datos locales.

# --- Secrets y env ---
# Los .gitignore de Spring no ignoran esto. Incluye backend-ms-springboot/.env
# (con GOOGLE_API_KEY) y frontend-react-typescript/.env
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
**/private*.pem
**/*private-key*
secrets/

# --- Uploads / storage runtime ---
# document-service guarda en ./storage/documents (ver storage.location en
# config-server/src/main/resources/config/document-service.yaml).
# Se crea por código en FileStorageService (Files.createDirectories),
# por eso se ignora la carpeta completa, sin .gitkeep.
backend-ms-springboot/microservices/document-service/storage/
**/storage/
**/uploads/
**/uploaded-documents/
*.pdf.orig

# --- Build outputs (global monorepo) ---
**/target/
**/build/
**/out/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/coverage/
**/.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear

# --- Frontend gaps (su .gitignore no cubre esto) ---
playwright-report/
test-results/
coverage/
lib/
.tmp/
.temp/

# --- IDE / editores / agentes ---
# Decisión usuario: ignorar .vscode y .opencode a todo nivel
.vscode/
**/.vscode/
.idea/
**/.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
.opencode/
**/.opencode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Logs y temporales ---
*.log
**/*.log
logs/
**/logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
hs_err_pid*
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
.cache/
**/.cache/

# --- Docker / DB datos locales ---
# compose usa volúmenes nombrados, esto es por si se usan bind-mounts locales
data/
pgdata/
mongo-data/
postgres-data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# --- RAG / modelos / vectores locales ---
**/vector-store/
**/chroma/
**/.faiss/
*.onnx
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.safetensors

# --- Otros ---
HELP.md
